<title>USA: Forest Laboratories Inc posts Q3 net loss.</title>
<headline>Forest Laboratories Inc posts Q3 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Mos ended 12/31    9 Mos ended 12/31</p>
<p>				 1996     1995     1996	1995</p>
<p> Net sales		$40,604 $122,870  $221,102   $339,498</p>
<p> Other income	     2,058    2,127    25,501(A)   9,842</p>
<p>  Net revenues	   42,662  124,997   246,603    349,340</p>
<p>Income (loss) before</p>
<p>    taxes		 (49,861)  38,740   (10,190)   125,568</p>
<p> Income taxes-benefit (17,548)  13,869    (5,316)    44,953</p>
<p>  Net income (loss)   (32,313)  24,871    (4,874)(A) 80,615</p>
<p> Net EPS		     (.76)     .53	(.11)(A)   1.72</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs	   42,750   46,855    44,412     46,880</p>
<p>		    (In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>Certain amounts as previously reported have been reclassified to conform to current quarter classifications.</p>
<p>(A) Included a non-recurring gain of $19,149 or $12,687 ($.29 per share) after taxes.  </p>
<p>NOTE: The net loss in the quarter included a pretax writedown of $3,500,000 or $2,250,000 after tax for monies owed to Forest by Foxmeyer Drug.</p>
</text>
